<title>CYPRUS: Toepfer, Andre and Cie win Cyprus grain tenders.</title>
<headline>Toepfer, Andre and Cie win Cyprus grain tenders.</headline>
<dateline>NICOSIA 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Cyprus Grain Commission has accepted a tender from Toepfer Athens for 25,000 tonnes of barley at $148.62 per tonne and one from Andre and Cie for 18,000 tonnes of corn at $158.95, it said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Prices are C&amp;F and both shipments are scheduled for the second half of October, the commission said in a statement.</p>
<p>--Nicosia newsroom 357 2 365089</p>
</text>
